<view class="page"><view class="title">开店准备</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view>干货、茶叶、五金均可使用；没有商品也能先记单。</view><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新真实准备进度</button><block wx:if="{{info}}"><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{info.steps}}" wx:key="id">{{item.complete?'已具备':'待完善/待接入'}} · {{item.label}}</view><view>分类 {{info.category_count}} / 商品 {{info.product_count}}</view><view>{{info.notice}}</view></view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="settings" disabled="{{busy}}">店铺资料/交付说明</button><button bindtap="catalog" disabled="{{busy}}">分类与商品</button><button bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy}}">店内预览</button><button bindtap="later" disabled="{{busy}}">稍后完善，直接记单</button></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{preview}}"><view>{{info.store.name || '尚未保存店铺'}}</view><view>{{info.store.description}}</view><view>{{info.store.public_contact}} {{info.store.public_address}}</view><view>{{info.store.delivery_note}}</view><view wx:for="{{info.preview_products}}" wx:key="index">{{item.name}} · {{item.spec}} · {{item.unit}} · {{item.status}}</view><view>最多预览20件，完整清单在分类与商品。</view><view>这是店内配置预览；微信分享/二维码待接入，不代表真实分享已验证。</view></view></block><view class="muted">CSV清单导入请使用Web工作台「开店准备/CSV导入」。可选，不影响文字询货和快速代记。</view></view>
